<title>NEW ZEALAND: BNZ cuts fixed business and farm lending rates.</title>
<headline>BNZ cuts fixed business and farm lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New Zealand said on Tuesday it was cutting its fixed business and farm lending rates to pass on the benefits of lower long-term wholesale interest rates.</p>
<p>It cut the six-month rate to 10.5 percent from 10.75, the one-year to 9.95 from 10.25, the two-year to 9.75 from 9.95 and the three, four and five-year rates to 9.25 percent from 9.75 percent, all effective from Wednesday. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
